{"schemaVersion":1,"id":-40543,"sections":[{"id":"script-20543","name":"原始脚本 20543","scripts":[20543],"start":0,"count":67}],"frames":[{"kind":"dialogue","head":1108,"speaker":"约塔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:1","scriptId":20543,"text":"“呼……”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1108,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:2","scriptId":20543,"text":"这叹气的人名叫约塔，是一名下位旅行者，按职能分的话归属于歼灭姬。","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1108,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:3","scriptId":20543,"text":"主要负责作战的约塔对自己的火力很自信，而她在歼灭姬中火力也确实属于翘楚之流。","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1108,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:4","scriptId":20543,"text":"不过由于现在上位的最高领导集团发生内部矛盾（泰莱塔VS阿尔库涅…），所以约塔手里并没有像样的工作。","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1108,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1108,"speaker":"约塔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:5","scriptId":20543,"text":"“自从泰莱塔大人和阿尔库涅大人吵架以来，就一直这么原地待命啊……好无聊。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1108,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":12,"speaker":"西格玛","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:6","scriptId":20543,"text":"“待命就是这么回事，不过这次确实有点久，你想出去透透气我也赞同，但……”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1108,"right":12,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:7","scriptId":20543,"text":"西格玛很不以为然地回了一句，她正在摆弄操作仪上的动态模型。","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1108,"right":12,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":12,"speaker":"西格玛","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:8","scriptId":20543,"text":"“中途要是有召集命令的话……你出去透气的事我可不会帮你隐瞒。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1108,"right":12,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1108,"speaker":"约塔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:9","scriptId":20543,"text":"“呃，算了……那个，召集命令来了的话，我们是听谁的？泰莱塔大人还是阿尔库涅大人？”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1108,"right":12,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":12,"speaker":"西格玛","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:10","scriptId":20543,"text":"“……我当然还是听从泰莱塔大人的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1108,"right":12,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1108,"speaker":"约塔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:11","scriptId":20543,"text":"“那你这意思是要违抗阿尔库涅大人咯？”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1108,"right":12,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":12,"speaker":"西格玛","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:12","scriptId":20543,"text":"“呜……”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1108,"right":12,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:13","scriptId":20543,"text":"像是被抓住话柄的西格玛楞了下，随后她斜眼瞪了瞪约塔。","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1108,"right":12,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":12,"speaker":"西格玛","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:14","scriptId":20543,"text":"“我是说如果两位大人同时召集的话，那我会听从泰莱塔大人的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1108,"right":12,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1108,"speaker":"约塔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:15","scriptId":20543,"text":"“不过现在这个基地里人有点少啊，埃普西隆和兰布达都去了阿尔库涅大人那里。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1108,"right":12,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":12,"speaker":"西格玛","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:16","scriptId":20543,"text":"“本来这里也主要是用于联络的基地，人少人多不碍事，难道是没人陪你玩了？”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1108,"right":12,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1108,"speaker":"约塔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:17","scriptId":20543,"text":"“说不无聊那肯定是谎话，只是比较在意那些到阿尔库涅大人那边去的人。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1108,"right":12,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":12,"speaker":"西格玛","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:18","scriptId":20543,"text":"“兰布达的话到哪儿都没问题，反正她的研究产物最终都会呈交给星团，只是换了个开发环境而已。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1108,"right":12,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":12,"speaker":"西格玛","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:19","scriptId":20543,"text":"“埃普西隆估计会惹不少麻烦吧，不过对我们来说是好事，她不在这里反倒清静也不会额外增加食物消耗。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1108,"right":12,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1108,"speaker":"约塔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:20","scriptId":20543,"text":"“确实呢～哈哈～”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1108,"right":12,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:21","scriptId":20543,"text":"就在这时西格玛身边的通信器响了……","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1108,"right":12,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:24","scriptId":20543,"text":"夜幕下，一列高级火车缓缓驶入站台，可以看到车厢里坐着许多身着华贵服饰的乘客。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:25","scriptId":20543,"text":"火车到站后，这些光鲜的客人都纷纷离开了列车，除了某位蹲在车顶的黑影……？","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:26","scriptId":20543,"text":"待到人群都离开只剩几个车检人员的时候，这个黑影从车顶上腾地一声跳到了站台的一角。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1108,"speaker":"约塔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:27","scriptId":20543,"text":"“每次看人类的设施总会觉得有些滑稽～作为移动据点简直漏洞摆出嘛。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":1108,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:28","scriptId":20543,"text":"约塔接到的指令是来自泰莱塔的，打算在这里拦截运输往死水的新兵器。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":1108,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1108,"speaker":"约塔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:29","scriptId":20543,"text":"“先找个适合制高点……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":1108,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:30","scriptId":20543,"text":"约塔左顾右盼了一阵，发现一处比较适合的位置。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":1108,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1108,"speaker":"约塔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:31","scriptId":20543,"text":"“那儿好像不错。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":1108,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:32","scriptId":20543,"text":"正当约塔刚离开车站没多远——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":1108,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1108,"speaker":"约塔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:35","scriptId":20543,"text":"“什么！？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":1108,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:36","scriptId":20543,"text":"约塔所在的位置遭受到了不明方向的攻击，约塔躲闪不及，只能把自己的重炮挡在身前。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":1108,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1108,"speaker":"约塔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:39","scriptId":20543,"text":"“啧……可恶，到底是怎么回事。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":1108,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:40","scriptId":20543,"text":"约塔的重炮发生了龟裂想要反击已经不可能了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":1108,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1,"speaker":"？？？","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:41","scriptId":20543,"text":"“约塔你还是老样子，执行任务的时候太懈怠了，竟然一点防备都没有。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":1108,"right":1,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:42","scriptId":20543,"text":"约塔循声望去看到了熟悉的身影。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":1108,"right":1,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1108,"speaker":"约塔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:43","scriptId":20543,"text":"“兰布达、还有德尔塔！？你们这是什么意思！？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":1108,"right":1,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":62,"speaker":"德尔塔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:44","scriptId":20543,"text":"“抱歉，我们这也是奉命行事……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":1108,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:45","scriptId":20543,"text":"约塔这下明白自己为什么会遭到伏击了，以兰布达的感知能力，发现约塔是轻而易举的事情。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":1108,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:46","scriptId":20543,"text":"“艾丽莎大人觉得泰莱塔大人一定会来妨碍新兵器的开发，所以故意放的风声。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":1108,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1108,"speaker":"约塔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:47","scriptId":20543,"text":"“艾丽莎大人？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":1108,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:48","scriptId":20543,"text":"“阿尔库涅大人的地球名字，你忘了？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":1108,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:49","scriptId":20543,"text":"兰布达面不改色的继续说道。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":1108,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:50","scriptId":20543,"text":"“没想到泰莱塔大人没有督战，很幸运。现在由我带你去阿丽莎大人那边。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":1108,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:51","scriptId":20543,"text":"说完，兰布达把手搭在约塔的肩膀上——传送，约塔之前也被兰布达送到过其他的战区，所以对这个能力并不陌生。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":1108,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:54","scriptId":20543,"text":"白色的光束集结于一处，随着“嗖”的一声光芒开始消散，从中走出两个人影——约塔和兰布达。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":13,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:55","scriptId":20543,"text":"“来了啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":13,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:56","scriptId":20543,"text":"艾丽莎坐在德尔塔的研究室里（原本是波西娅的备用仓库）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":13,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:57","scriptId":20543,"text":"看到艾丽莎之后，约塔立刻屈膝半跪。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":13,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1108,"speaker":"约塔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:58","scriptId":20543,"text":"“阿尔库涅大人，召见属下什么事吗……？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":13,"right":1108,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":13,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:59","scriptId":20543,"text":"“嗯？兰布达你没和约塔说明原因吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":13,"right":1108,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:60","scriptId":20543,"text":"“还没有，属下认为这是带她过来是最快捷合理的做法。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":13,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:61","scriptId":20543,"text":"艾丽莎低头看了看约塔然后微微一笑。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":13,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":13,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:62","scriptId":20543,"text":"“是泰莱塔命令你去袭击站台的吧～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":13,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1108,"speaker":"约塔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:63","scriptId":20543,"text":"“是的……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":13,"right":1108,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":13,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:64","scriptId":20543,"text":"“那我现在告诉你，这个命令取消了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":13,"right":1108,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1108,"speaker":"约塔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:65","scriptId":20543,"text":"“什么！？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":13,"right":1108,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":13,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:66","scriptId":20543,"text":"“你有什么不满吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":13,"right":1108,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1108,"speaker":"约塔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:67","scriptId":20543,"text":"“不……属下不敢……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":13,"right":1108,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":13,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:68","scriptId":20543,"text":"“泰莱塔也不动动脑子，我们拥有同级的权限，凭什么她就可以随意指使下位？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":13,"right":1108,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1108,"speaker":"约塔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:69","scriptId":20543,"text":"“那个……大人们的纠葛与属下没有实际因果关系……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":13,"right":1108,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":13,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:70","scriptId":20543,"text":"“有啊，关系可大了，泰莱塔想调动下位来发动突袭，所以我觉得只要在那之前削弱她的兵力，让她搞不起来就行了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":13,"right":1108,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":13,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:71","scriptId":20543,"text":"“当然我也不会为难你，如果泰莱塔问起了，你就说因为武器被毁，在我这里修理就行了～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":13,"right":1108,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:72","scriptId":20543,"text":"艾丽莎指了指约塔手里的武器，本来已经有所碎裂，由于传送的关系破损的非常严重。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":13,"right":1108,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:73","scriptId":20543,"text":"经艾丽莎的提醒约塔这才发现自己宝贵的武器已经变成了废铜烂铁一般的样子。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":13,"right":1108,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1108,"speaker":"约塔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:74","scriptId":20543,"text":"“诶——————！？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":13,"right":1108,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1108,"speaker":"约塔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20543:20543:75","scriptId":20543,"text":"（等等，这不是软禁吗？姑且先听艾丽莎大人的，反正对我也没什么坏处～）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":13,"right":1108,"section":0,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
